  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## xi-eta Ghost System Tests\n\nThe xi-eta ghost system has the OPEs:\n$$\\eta(z) \\xi(w) \\sim \\frac{1}{z-w}$$\n$$\\xi(z) \\eta(w) \\sim -\\frac{1}{z-w}$$\n\nNote: The sign differs depending on ordering (fermionic system).",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {},
   "executionSummary": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### Test 7: Basic eta-xi contraction\n\nWick[eta[0,z], xi[0,w]] should give 1/(z-w)",
