  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## Exponential of phi Tests (expPhib, expPhif)\n\nThe exponentials of phi have the following contractions:\n\n**SWick** (single contraction with dphi):\n$$\\text{SWick}[\\partial\\phi(z), e^{a\\phi}(w)] = \\frac{-a}{z-w}$$\n\n**MWick** (mutual contraction between exponentials):\n$$\\text{MWick}[e^{a\\phi}(z), e^{b\\phi}(w)] = (z-w)^{-ab}$$",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {},
   "executionSummary": {}
