  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### Test 31: OPE of R[dphi] with R[expPhib]\n\nThe OPE combines SWick with expPhib and the regular normal-ordered term.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {},
   "executionSummary": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "test31 = OPE[R[d\\[Phi][0, z]], R[exp\\[Phi]b[a, w]]];\nPrint[\"Test 31 (OPE dphi-expPhib): \", test31 // InputForm];\n(* Check that result contains expPhib and has a pole *)\ntest31Result = Not[FreeQ[test31, exp\\[Phi]b]] && (Not[FreeQ[test31, 1/(z - w)]] || Not[FreeQ[test31, 1/(w - z)]]);\nPrint[\"Test 31 (has expPhib and pole): \", If[test31Result, \"PASSED\", \"FAILED\"]];\ntest31Result",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<pre>Test 31 (OPE dphi-expPhib): -((a*R[expÏb[a, w]])/(-w + z)) + \n \n&gt;    R[dÏ[0, z], expÏb[a, w]]\n</pre>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
