  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### Test 32: OPE of R[eta, xi] with R[xi] (composite with single field)\n\nTests that eta in the composite contracts with the external xi.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {},
   "executionSummary": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "test32 = OPE[R[\\[Eta][0, z], \\[Xi][0, z]], R[\\[Xi][0, w]]];\nPrint[\"Test 32 (OPE R[eta,xi]-xi): \", test32 // InputForm];\n(* Should have a singular term from eta-xi contraction *)\ntest32HasSingular = Not[FreeQ[test32, 1/(w - z)]] || Not[FreeQ[test32, 1/(z - w)]];\nPrint[\"Test 32 has singular term: \", If[test32HasSingular, \"PASSED\", \"FAILED\"]];\ntest32HasSingular",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
